
# machine translated (Arabic), not yet reviewed by a person.

# Reason shown when a picture of a kind that cannot be turned is turned.
folders-imaging-no-turn = لا يمكن تدوير غير صور JPEG وPNG وWebP وBMP

# Reason shown when a picture file could not be read for turning or resizing.
folders-imaging-unreadable = تعذّرت قراءة الصورة

# Reason shown when a resized picture would have to be written in a kind Folders cannot write.
folders-imaging-no-write = ليس نوع صور يكتبه Folders

# Why a link to a picture is not turned.
folders-imaging-no-turn-link = الرابط لا يُدار؛ أدِر الصورة التي يشير إليها

# Why a moving picture is not turned.
folders-imaging-no-turn-moving = الصورة المتحركة لا تُدار، لأن أول صورة فيها فقط هي التي ستبقى

